You can also use a while loop to count down. 
This example counts from 3 to 1, and then prints "Happy New Year!!" at the end:

Example
int countdown = 3;

while (countdown > 0) {
 System.out.println(countdown);
 countdown--;
}

System.out.println("Happy New Year!!");

Try it Yourself »

