which is used to pass information:

Example
Create a method that accepts an int parameter called x. In the main() method, 
we call myMethod() and set an int parameter of 10:

 public
 class MyClass {
  static void myMethod(int x) {

 System.out.println(x);
  }

  public static 
 void main(String[] args) {
    myMethod(10);
  }
}

// Outputs 10

